 <subsection title="Intel C/C++ Compiler Intrinsic Equivalent">
  <para unique="1046276">VFMADD132PH, VFMADD213PH , and VFMADD231PH:</para>
  <para unique="1046277">__m128h _mm_fmadd_ph (__m128h a, __m128h b, __m128h c);</para>
  <para unique="1046278">__m128h _mm_mask_fmadd_ph (__m128h a, __mmask8 k, __m128h b, __m128h c);</para>
